{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Four points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10cb764f88509fb1c8012366993fdbee98f31bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$W$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3ead47fb9fb4a4c273feee398f72ff2a09702b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z$\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> are placed along a number line such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/434b43c3ed50dfcfe55a5a68619bfe75826a1aee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WX$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> is two-thirds of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb2419be49ff83cbed7db9a2f366858ccabf2e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XZ$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/4/854bf4459317b2ed4a2d3ff5a6a243ff01d50274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WY$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> is twice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aab17e2f2005ca643854186430099294ad84b85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$YZ$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(W -&gt; to the left of X, X -&gt; to the left of Y, Y -&gt; to the left of Z)\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/516e31ab335c676db0c1e212148d51f5baa922d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WX = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7774174993ffa29a38cf577ae34d8e0a3a63cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/516e31ab335c676db0c1e212148d51f5baa922d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WX = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/4/434b43c3ed50dfcfe55a5a68619bfe75826a1aee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WX$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb2419be49ff83cbed7db9a2f366858ccabf2e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XZ$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/74678309642cf8a32da869e4284aad3f0668fe29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3} \\times XZ = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/d/b2d896343dea8f854e96a13e35099d42e1f28b6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XZ = \\frac{12}{\\frac{2}{3}} = 12 \\times \\frac{3}{2} = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"199\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>We can also see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f1f446aa6883a55ce19efd88ab941814292ea8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WX + XZ = WZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"16\" />, which gives:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/a/fba9bd599f225bc8a136492f6ba7edfee4ca8db8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WZ = 12 + 18 = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aab17e2f2005ca643854186430099294ad84b85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$YZ$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/4/854bf4459317b2ed4a2d3ff5a6a243ff01d50274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WY$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> is twice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aab17e2f2005ca643854186430099294ad84b85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$YZ$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />, it would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/808d70ce29110acbfa47228747db2e682cf103ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>From the line, we notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/f/1bfed9388cf30b95b56b82c71b31fdc8a0f251f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WY + YZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" /> is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f6fdf2d48244959cf6c66b683a59d4e63e5423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$WZ$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" />. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff45ae2a64ccb7e015375a8cf400db96a976e82c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d + 2d = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b19a082f96d63d4f34fda112e8e9c674e837287e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3d = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/c/04c90b87d628a49c40dd50cfec4c9dd511d410a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = \\frac{30}{3} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>From the line, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/d/a7d79f3f9d7d56b4d12766ef69a46faa8b4dccf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY + YZ = XZ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e8a0b092c54e915983815c3b5dc4a0eed42ff3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY + 10 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/2/4720783eca27d2f05880584c1c4c4b1f16ced1f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY = 18 - 10 = \\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"160\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 9 (page does no