CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 4\">Practice Relay 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 1\">Relay A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 2\">Relay A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 3\">Relay A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay A Problem 4\">Relay A 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 1\">Relay B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 2\">Relay B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Relay B 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Relay B 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 2\">Relay C 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Team_Up_Challenge\" title=\"CEMC Team Up Challenge\">CEMC Team Up Challenge</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025943\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 186/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3335/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 160/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5205/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   17.183      1 -total\n 48.84%    8.393      1 Template:CEMC_TUC_box\n 31.32%    5.381      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35698:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025943 and revision id 278351. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}